{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-15", "prepared_on": "2026-08-15", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-15</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Vulnerability giving attackers full control of Macs is under active exploitation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">讓攻擊者完全控制 Mac 的漏洞正遭主動利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A screen-sharing bug lets remote hackers log in without a password, granting full control of affected Macs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">螢幕共享漏洞讓遠端駭客無需密碼即可登入，取得受影響 Mac 的完整控制權。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/08/vulnerability-giving-attackers-full-control-of-macs-is-under-active-exploitation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Google will now allow users to remove visible watermark from its AI generations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 開放使用者移除 AI 生成內容的可見浮水印</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Turning off the new setting in Gemini and Flow won't affect the invisible watermark used to identify AI-generated files.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在 Gemini 與 Flow 中關閉此設定不會影響用來識別 AI 生成檔案的隱形浮水印。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/14/google-will-now-allow-users-to-remove-visible-watermark-from-its-ai-generations/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI and Anthropic in price war as Chinese AI rivals gain ground<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">中國AI對手步步進逼，OpenAI與Anthropic陷入價格戰</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">US AI groups are releasing cheaper models as Chinese rivals challenge their trillion-dollar ambitions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">面對中國業者的挑戰，美國AI業者相繼推出更便宜的模型以捍衛其兆美元級的野心。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/openai-and-anthropic-in-price-war-as-chinese-ai-rivals-gain-ground/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Government Networks Become AI Agent Attack Testbeds, TeamT5 CEO Warns of New Era of Automated Attacks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">政府系統淪AI Agent攻擊實戰場，TeamT5執行長：自動化攻擊已進入新時代</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Financial Times cited a report on a fully autonomous AI attack framework, built on the Hermes and OpenClaw agent systems, that infiltrated an Asian government agency over four days, autonomously researching exploits and exfiltrating over 160MB of data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國《金融時報》引述報告指出，一套建立在Hermes與OpenClaw代理框架上的自主AI攻擊系統，對亞洲某政府機關發動長達四天的入侵，自主研究漏洞並外洩逾160MB資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178135\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Google Unveils Gemini 3.7 Flash at Half the Price of Its Predecessor<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google公布Gemini 3.7 Flash，價格為前代一半</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google says its latest coding and agentic model improves software engineering and reasoning performance while costing half as much per million tokens as Gemini 3.6 Flash.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google表示這款最新程式撰寫暨代理人開發模型在軟體工程與推理能力上有所提升，且每百萬token價格僅前代的一半。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178126\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Apple Trained Its Own AI Model for China With Help From Alibaba<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果與阿里巴巴合作，為中國市場訓練專屬AI模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple reportedly trained a custom AI model for the China market with domestic tech giant Alibaba, a rare cross-border deal amid rising US-China tensions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果據傳與中國科技巨頭阿里巴巴合作，為中國市場訓練客製化AI模型，在北京與華府關係緊張之際顯得格外罕見。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/980160/apple-intelligence-china-custom-ai-model-alibaba\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> More AI Agents Isn't Always Better: Anthropic Study Finds Collaboration Can Backfire<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI代理不是越多越有效率，協作恐現資源爭用與相互封鎖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's experiments with multi-agent systems sharing a codebase found more agents doesn't necessarily improve efficiency — it can trigger code conflicts, resource contention, and agents blocking each other's work.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic測試多個AI代理共用程式碼庫的協作狀況，發現代理數量增加未必提升效率，反而可能引發程式碼衝突、資源爭奪甚至相互阻礙工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178146\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> LiteLLM Supply Chain Attack May Have Hit Over 2,500 Organizations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">LiteLLM供應鏈攻擊恐波及逾2,500家企業</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm CloudSEK says the March supply chain attack on open-source LLM connector LiteLLM may affect over 2,500 companies and roughly 434,000 CI/CD workflows.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安公司CloudSEK調查指出，今年3月針對開源LLM串接套件LiteLLM的供應鏈攻擊，可能波及全球逾2,500家企業與約43.4萬個CI/CD工作流程。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178138\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> OpenAI Previews Ultrafast Mode, Running GPT-5.6 Sol Up to 14x Faster<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI預覽Ultrafast模式，GPT-5.6 Sol速度最高快14倍</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Powered by Cerebras infrastructure, the new API tier can output up to 750 tokens per second, targeting latency-sensitive use cases like incident response and customer support.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">採用Cerebras運算架構，這項新API服務層級最高可達每秒750 token輸出，鎖定事件回應、客服等高時效應用場景。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178139\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Databricks Wanted to Raise $1B, Investors Wanted $15B — It Settled on $5B at a $190B Valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Databricks原想募10億美元，投資人想投150億，最終以190億估值募得50億</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI is expensive, CEO Ali Ghodsi tells TechCrunch — with so many investors wanting in, he agreed to raise far more than originally planned.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Databricks執行長Ali Ghodsi表示AI開發成本高昂，由於太多投資人搶著參與這輪募資，最終募得金額遠超原訂計畫。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/13/databricks-wanted-to-raise-1b-investors-wanted-15b-it-settled-on-5b-at-a-190b-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}